/api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":680,"closed_issues":22796,"state":"open","created_at":"2018-01-18T16:52:20Z","updated_at":"2026-03-11T06:25:22Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":5,"created_at":"2017-08-10T13:38:38Z","updated_at":"2020-07-17T16:14:02Z","closed_at":"2020-06-16T16:45:34Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## I'm submitting a...\r\n[x] Bug report \r\nor\r\n[x] Documentation issue or request\r\n</code></pre>\r\n\r\n## Current behavior\r\nWhen using routerLink with both a fragment and queryParams, routerLink generates a link with first the queryParams and the fragment at the end.\r\n\r\nexample: \r\n```\r\n<a [routerLink]=\"['/user/bob']\" [queryParams]=\"{debug: true}\" fragment=\"education\">\r\n  link to user component\r\n</a>\r\n```\r\ngenerates: /user/bob?debug=true#education\r\n\r\n\r\n## Expected behavior\r\nAccording to routerLink documentation, it should be returned in the opposite order: \r\n\r\n/user/bob#education?debug=true\r\n\r\n## Minimal reproduction\r\n\r\n[https://plnkr.co/edit/xT92m1lGjoGCM3EVa6TG?p=info](https://plnkr.co/edit/xT92m1lGjoGCM3EVa6TG?p=info)\r\n\r\n## What is the motivation / use case for changing the behavior?\r\nEither routerLink is behaving incorrectly or the documentation has an error.\r\n\r\n\r\n## Environment\r\n\r\n<pre><code>\r\n@angular/cli: 1.2.4\r\n@angular/animations: 4.3.1\r\n@angular/common: 4.3.1\r\n@angular/compiler: 4.3.1\r\n@angular/compiler-cli: 4.3.1\r\n@angular/core: 4.3.1\r\n@angular/forms: 4.3.1\r\n@angular/http: 4.3.1\r\n@angular/platform-browser: 4.3.1\r\n@angular/platform-browser-dynamic: 4.3.1\r\n@angular/platform-server: 4.3.1\r\n@angular/router: 4.3.1\r\n@angular/cli: 1.2.4\r\n\r\n\r\nBrowser:\r\n- [x] Chrome (iOS) version XX\r\n \r\nFor Tooling issues:\r\n- Node version: 7.4.0\r\n- Platform:  Mac\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"mhevery","id":111951,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMTk1MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111951?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhevery","html_url":"https://github.com/mhevery","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhevery/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhevery/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhevery/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhevery/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhevery/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhevery/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhevery/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhevery/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhevery/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/18630/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/18630/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}